"https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/4ea0/6fbc/770_normal.png?m=1768280127", "title": "职场话题", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/go/career", "topics": 24083, "footer": "", "header": "这里，我们聊聊那些工作中遇到的开心和不开心的事。", "title_alternative": "Career", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/4ea0/6fbc/770_mini.png?m=1768280127", "stars": 3724, "founder_id": 0, "aliases": [], "root": false, "id": 770, "parent_node_name": ""}, "member": {"id": 640917, "username": "jingcjie", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/u/jingcjie", "website": "jingcjie.top", "twitter": null, "psn": null, "github": null, "btc": null, "location": "", "tagline": "", "bio": "", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/9279/e35d/640917_mini.png?m=1762837003", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/9279/e35d/640917_normal.png?m=1762837003", "avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/9279/e35d/640917_large.png?m=1762837003", "avatar_xlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/9279/e35d/640917_xlarge.png?m=1762837003", "avatar_xxlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/9279/e35d/640917_xxlarge.png?m=1762837003", "created": 1690615700, "last_modified": 1762837003, "pro": 0}, "last_reply_by": "deszon", "last_touched": 1786667912, "title": "秋招工作是真难找啊，试了很多路子，想听点建议。", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/t/1234077", "created": 1786599253, "deleted": 0, "content": "我的简历： https://y06c8e8us2nknqg9.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/resumes/jie_resume_chinese.pdf\r\n主页：jingcjie.top\r\n\r\n我能想到的公司全都投了，能找内推的也推了，目前主投的字节，阿里，oppo 都没进面试。腾讯做世界模型的进了三面然后凉凉。\r\n\r\n现在手里的 offer 全是博后的，业界一个都还没有。\r\n\r\n我应该尝试一下哪些平台吗？之前试了下牛客，但我发现牛客也会引流到各大官网，然后和我让同学内推的其实是一个效果。大多帖子也不太有意义，只好让 codex 筛了我来投。", "content_rendered": "<p>我的简历： <a href=\"https://y06c8e8us2nknqg9.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/resumes/jie_resume_chinese.pdf\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://y06c8e8us2nknqg9.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/resumes/jie_resume_chinese.pdf</a>\n主页：jingcjie.top</p>\n<p>我能想到的公司全都投了，能找内推的也推了，目前主投的字节，阿里，oppo 都没进面试。腾讯做世界模型的进了三面然后凉凉。</p>\n<p>现在手里的 offer 全是博后的，业界一个都还没有。</p>\n<p>我应该尝试一下哪些平台吗？之前试了下牛客，但我发现牛客也会引流到各大官网，然后和我让同学内推的其实是一个效果。大多帖子也不太有意义，只好让 codex 筛了我来投。</p>\n", "last_modified": 1786599253, "replies": 148, "id": 1234077}, {"node": {"avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/6e27/13a6/557_large.png?m=1747623425", "name": "life", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/6e27/13a6/557_normal.png?m=1747623425", "title": "生活", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/go/life", "topics": 11476, "footer": "", "header": "生活中的技术讨论", "title_alternative": "Life", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/6e27/13a6/557_mini.png?m=1747623425", "stars": 2430, "founder_id": 0, "aliases": [], "root": false, "id": 557, "parent_node_name": ""}, "member": {"id": 575994, "username": "qemu32", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/u/qemu32", "website": null, "twitter": null, "psn": null, "github": null, "btc": null, "location": null, "tagline": null, "bio": null, "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/36553c9ecf2c5169b24e6c3f8e83eac6?s=24&d=retro", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/36553c9ecf2c5169b24e6c3f8e83eac6?s=48&d=retro", "avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/36553c9ecf2c5169b24e6c3f8e83eac6?s=73&d=retro", "created": 1647645973, "last_modified": 1647645973, "pro": 0}, "last_reply_by": "ZAN0029", "last_touched": 1786612055, "title": "感觉自己被这个社会判了死刑。", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/t/1234133", "created": 1786607481, "deleted": 0, "content": "我 24 年 7 月被裁后就一直在家宅着，当时是真的不想硬逼着自己赶紧去找下份工作，为了在家不无聊所以陆陆续续买了不少电子产品在家玩，也一直没投简历，今年年初才开始逼着自己找工作，本来是想着如果彻底没希望在这个行业混就回老家，别再在这里浪费钱了，但现在还是没办法逼自己回去。\r\n\r\n回不去的原因主要是因为在我小时候虐待我，当着我的面把我的宠物猫摔死的那个人渣还没死，今年年初听说它肺癌扩散了，肯定是活不了了，但就是不知道啥时候死，我很怕它再活个 1 年 2 年，那我就算把电脑全都卖了也撑不到那个时候。\r\n\r\n我本来不想发这种帖子脏 V 友的眼睛，但是我目前的情况去找 AI 倾诉已经不起任何作用了，所以还是想找个地方说出来，我知道说出来也不会有啥用，但至少能让我稍微喘口气。\r\n\r\n这个帖子写出来的只是一点点，都写出来我这个号就没了。", "content_rendered": "<p>我 24 年 7 月被裁后就一直在家宅着，当时是真的不想硬逼着自己赶紧去找下份工作，为了在家不无聊所以陆陆续续买了不少电子产品在家玩，也一直没投简历，今年年初才开始逼着自己找工作，本来是想着如果彻底没希望在这个行业混就回老家，别再在这里浪费钱了，但现在还是没办法逼自己回去。</p>\n<p>回不去的原因主要是因为在我小时候虐待我，当着我的面把我的宠物猫摔死的那个人渣还没死，今年年初听说它肺癌扩散了，肯定是活不了了，但就是不知道啥时候死，我很怕它再活个 1 年 2 年，那我就算把电脑全都卖了也撑不到那个时候。</p>\n<p>我本来不想发这种帖子脏 V 友的眼睛，但是我目前的情况去找 AI 倾诉已经不起任何作用了，所以还是想找个地方说出来，我知道说出来也不会有啥用，但至少能让我稍微喘口气。</p>\n<p>这个帖子写出来的只是一点点，都写出来我这个号就没了。</p>\n", "last_modified": 1786607481, "replies": 95, "id": 1234133}, {"node": {"avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/6e27/13a6/557_large.png?m=1747623425", "name": "life", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/6e27/13a6/557_normal.png?m=1747623425", "title": "生活", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/go/life", "topics": 11476, "footer": "", "header": "生活中的技术讨论", "title_alternative": "Life", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/6e27/13a6/557_mini.png?m=1747623425", "stars": 2430, "founder_id": 0, "aliases": [], "root": false, "id": 557, "parent_node_name": ""}, "member": {"id": 664441, "username": "GTsss", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/u/GTsss", "website": null, "twitter": null, "psn": null, "github": null, "btc": null, "location": null, "tagline": null, "bio": null, "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/5ff2/bf31/664441_mini.png?m=1786584434", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/5ff2/bf31/664441_normal.png?m=1786584434", "avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/5ff2/bf31/664441_large.png?m=1786584434", "avatar_xlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/5ff2/bf31/664441_xlarge.png?m=1786584434", "avatar_xxlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/5ff2/bf31/664441_xxlarge.png?m=1786584434", "avatar_xxxlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/5ff2/bf31/664441_xxxlarge.png?m=1786584434", "created": 1701048975, "last_modified": 1786584434, "pro": 0}, "last_reply_by": "drminutes", "last_touched": 1786633834, "title": "今天 30 岁生日，替大家许个愿望", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/t/1234005", "created": 1786585058, "deleted": 0, "content": "老哥们有什么 30 岁的建议或愿望，欢迎交流", "content_rendered": "老哥们有什么 30 岁的建议或愿望，欢迎交流", "last_modified": 1786594618, "replies": 81, "id": 1234005}, {"node": {"avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/fd2c/5e46/1135_large.png?m=1751736785", "name": "openai", "avatar_nor